ed-unit count is zero."},{"requirement":"node1 initial diagnostic restart","command_ids":["cmd-246486e8fa124e0a","cmd-3240edf789a5435c","cmd-6513707156ee4c9d","cmd-f67c34dc32944122","cmd-5920a72105284303"],"summary":"Captures healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot identity, recovered system/database/timer, and metadata-only false positives that led to rule refinement."},{"requirement":"node1 final mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-2405c51e77fe45d3","cmd-d2fb1481cd904832","cmd-518b31791df04cc9","cmd-cea07feec7e04e2f","cmd-9faddb4ebe534bc1","cmd-465c05692ef141fc"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from c7c14430-50b3-4830-9b49-8b34c08f101a to e4d8a540-e104-4e33-a9f5-1367f037e76c. The database checksum persisted, timer recovered enabled/active, reporting succeeded, integrity remained clean, and the system had zero failed units."}]}
